관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n다음과 같은 임피던스 벡터궤적을 갖는 회로는?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 병렬회로이며, 고정, 가변\n\n② 직렬회로이며, 고정, 가변\n\n③ 병렬회로이며, 가변, 고정\n\n④ 직렬회로이며, 고정, 가변\n\n⑤ 병렬회로이며, 고정, 가변","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":1081},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m05-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 2Ω의 저항에 흐르는 전류A 는?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 28          ② 29\n\n③ 30          ④ 32\n\n⑤ 34","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m06-q.webp","width":678,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m06-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n다음과 같은 T형 4단자 회로망에서 Ω,\nΩ, Ω일 때, 4단자 정수 는?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 1.002        ② 1.02\n\n③ 1.2          ④ 200.02\n\n⑤ 200.002","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":746},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m07-e1.webp","width":678,"height":795}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n분포정수회로에 대한 설명으로 틀린 것은?\n\n\n① 선로의 길이는 주파수 신호의 파장에 비해 매우 길다.\n\n② 저항, 인덕턴스, 정전용량, 컨덕턴스가 선로에 걸쳐 균일\n\n  하게 분포된 것이다.\n\n③ 집중정수회로와 달리 특히 고주파수일 때 분포정수회로의\n\n  특성이 도드라진다.\n\n④ 선로의 길이에 따라 임피던스가 변하지 않는다.\n\n⑤ 전송선로, 도파관 등이 분포정수회로에 해당한다.","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":454},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m08-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1087}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S1-Q09","number":9,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 9번","searchText":" 09\n\n전송선로의 특성임피던스가 400Ω이고, 변이점 이후의\n\n임피던스가 600Ω일 때, 전류 투과계수와 전류 반사계수\n\n는 어떻게 되는가?\n\n       투과계수        반사계수\n\n ①           1.2                    0.8\n\n ②           1.2                    0.4\n\n ③           1.2                    0.2\n\n ④           0.8                     -0.2\n\n ⑤           0.8                    0.4","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m09","number":9},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m09-q.webp","width":696,"height":667},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m09-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1049}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S1-Q10","number":10,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 10번","searchText":" 10\n\n시스템 타입2에서 개루프 전달함수가\n\n           \n              인 시스템에 ‘계단함수’를 입\n\n력으로 하였을 때, 정상상태 오차는?\n\n(단, 는 이득상수이다.)\n\n\n①           ② \n\n③           ④ \n\n⑤ ∞","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e03-m10","number":10},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m10-q.webp","width":696,"height":679},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e03-m10-e1.webp","width":696,"height":833}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P081-S1-Q11","number":11,"question":"25.05.11 한국가스공사 (사람인) · 객관식 11번","searchText":" 11\n\n                     \n전달함수가         인 시스템의 입력신호를    \n\n단위계단함수 로 하였을 때, 정상상태 출력값은?\n\n\n①            ② \n\n③            ④ \n\n⑤ ∞","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"